          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": true,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.9999580206270503,
          "sentence": "It also reminds educators, parents, and individuals that success is not only about talent; it is also shaped by habits, purpose, emotional resilience, and the willingness to keep learning over time.",
          "perplexity": 0,
